DOCUMENTATION:
    PURPOSE: JAX_TEST all-pass pipeline efficiency
    INTENT:  Test only — every epoch detects, so the trigger draws no randoms
    NOTES:
        Lets a fixture isolate a selection gate from the stochastic
        efficiency test, which otherwise flips marginal-SNR epochs
        independently in each code.
    USAGE_KEY: SEARCHEFF_PIPELINE_EFF_FILE
    USAGE_CODE: snlc_sim.exe
DOCUMENTATION_END:

PHOTFLAG_DETECT:   4096
PHOTFLAG_TRIGGER:  2048

FILTER: u
ABS(SNR):     0.00  1.0
ABS(SNR):  1000.00  1.0

FILTER: g
ABS(SNR):     0.00  1.0
ABS(SNR):  1000.00  1.0

FILTER: r
ABS(SNR):     0.00  1.0
ABS(SNR):  1000.00  1.0

FILTER: i
ABS(SNR):     0.00  1.0
ABS(SNR):  1000.00  1.0

FILTER: z
ABS(SNR):     0.00  1.0
ABS(SNR):  1000.00  1.0

FILTER: Y
ABS(SNR):     0.00  1.0
ABS(SNR):  1000.00  1.0
